ght actually get Trump to  stop supporting Saudis war on Yemen it  would actually do something at least  potentially the possibility of possible  impeachment over Yemen might even get  Trump to stop support by the US military  of Saudi Arabia in Yemen without needing  impeachment in and of itself to even get  going in earnest and then lastly totally  separately there's a case to be made  that Donald Trump has violated the  emoluments clause in multiple ways  receiving things of value from foreign  nations including endless hotel revenue  from foreign leaders and diplomats who  say we're staying at Trump's hotel in  Washington DC specifically to curry  favor with them to ingratiate ourselves  with Donald Trump - maybe achieve some  kind of favorable position from Donald  Trump directly or from his  administration or his Justice Department  or Commerce Department or whoever else  it is you could make the argument on  emoluments for impeachment but again  this would be specifically because of  Yemen less political than obstruction  100 percent legally warranted and I  think it is a serious debate that within  the Democratic establishment has to  happen I believe that the threat of  impeachment immediately via impeachment  hearings in the house over Yemen could  actually get Donald Trump to change his  policy on that issue and it would  directly help the people people of Yemen  obstruction impeachment you're gonna get  the immediate buckle down the witch hunt  stuff you're gonna get a very very  different  action over Yemen if Donald Trump sees  that simply stopping our support of the  Saudi war there might make that threat  of impeachment go away it's actually  possible possible that he would go  forward and do that today's program is  sponsored in part by Blink accom /  Pakman if you've not already heard about  blink Asst it's amazing it's an app for  your phone tablet or web browser and  what they do is they take nonfiction  books popular nonfiction critically  accla